# BUILD OUTPUT THAT NO LONGER BELONGS HERE AT ALL.
#
# The page used to fetch the wasm and the glue from this directory by name, so
# `ace wasm make` outputs had to be copied in after every build -- ignored here
# because a 2MB binary per provider does not belong in the history of the page
# that loads them.
#
# They are not copied in any more: `ace wasm make` writes bin/wasm/, serve_web.etcs
# mounts that at /wasm/, and the page resolves its base there (resolveWasmBase in
# index.html). The entries stay so that a tree which still has the old copies
# keeps them out of a commit -- and so a stale one sitting here cannot be mistaken
# for the current artifact. Safe to delete them; the page prefers /wasm/ and only
# falls back to this directory for a deployment made before the split.
etcs.js
etcs.wasm
*.wasm
